breaking_changes.Adaptation_method:
Before: q.drain = () => { console.log('done'); };
After: q.drain(() => { console.log('done'); });

Or to await the next occurrence:
After: await q.drain();

Before: async.during(whileTest, worker, callback);
After: async.whilst(whileTest, worker, callback);

Or with async test:
After: await async.whilst(async () => condition(), async () => work());

Before: applyEach(fns, arg1, arg2, callback);
After: applyEach(fns)([arg1, arg2], callback);

Or with promise: const result = await applyEach(fns)([arg1, arg2]);
